00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.130
DINO CHIESA: Dino here.

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:08.560
If you've watched the other
videos in this series,

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.390
you're well on your
way to becoming

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:12.640
familiar with Apigee
Edge, and you're

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.320
seeing how you can
begin to exploit

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:18.540
the capabilities of Apigee to
further your digital business.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.090
You'll be able to continue using
Apigee Edge for the duration

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.980
of your evaluation.

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:26.530
Here are some suggestions
for helping you move forward.

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:29.040
First, if you'd like to share
this learning experience

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.750
with your teammates
or colleagues,

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.410
you can invite other people to
your Apigee Edge organization.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:36.630
You can work as a
team of collaborators,

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.420
building your API
program together.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.430
You can explore
further by joining us

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.260
for a virtual API jam.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:45.360
These are live webcast events.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:48.460
Check the events
page for details.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.010
If you want to further
your education with a more

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.050
thorough course of
training, please

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.230
visit academy.apigee.com,
where we have

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:58.630
extensive online courseware.

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:02.980
There you can get started on
the path to certification.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.569
In case you would
like to describe

00:01:04.569 --> 00:01:06.910
the capabilities of Apigee
Edge to your colleagues,

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:11.970
we've prepared some materials
you can use for that purpose.

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:14.750
Finally, if you'd like to have
a conversation with an Apigee

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.790
technical or sales
representative

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:20.900
to discuss solution scenarios,
architectures, capabilities

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.420
in more detail,
our sales team will

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:26.120
be more than happy to help.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.470
I hope you've enjoyed
this video series.

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:30.050
If you have any
feedback, we'd love

00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:32.300
to hear from you on
the Apigee community.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.760
Thank you, and as
always, keep it digital.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:38.110
